==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|baldekīn}}, from {{der|de|it|baldacchino}}, derived from {{m|it|Baldacca|t=the city of Baghdad}}, from {{der|de|ar|بَغْداد}}, from {{der|de|pal|-}}. The modern German spelling and pronunciation through readaptation to the Italian form, likely facilitated by association with {{m|de|Dach|t=roof}}.

